      "text": "In the mission, why are team B's names put into a set before team A is checked?",
      "options": [
        "So the names come out sorted",
        "So the set holds the scores as well",
        "Because a for loop can't go through a list of tuples",
        "So `in` checks a name quickly, with each name kept once"
